WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,890
I welcome you to challenge at any time, etc. What else?

2
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:09,090
You know that Wang Zhi was demoted to a handyman because of you, right?

3
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:10,590
He recently escaped death

4
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:13,090
I'm afraid I'm going to be shamed in front of a large sum of blood.

5
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,390
With Wang Zhi’s character

6
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:15,890
Even if he doesn’t need nouns

7
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:31,160
I will beat you to death, I know, Junior Brother Chu

8
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:36,250
It's not easy to find you. Senior Sister Ji has something to do.

9
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:38,750
My master broke through the fifth level three days ago

10
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:41,050
Today is the day to become an elder

11
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:42,550
Congratulations to Elder Fang

12
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,850
What does senior sister want from me?

13
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,950
Master wants to see you, come with me quickly

14
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:52,630
This is the Suzuru I saw you with, right?

15
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,030
Why is it three quarters?
